WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.423
Unit twenty-two. Drowning Prevention!

2
00:00:04.396 --> 00:00:08.384
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:11.921
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.971 --> 00:00:15.900
Today we learn about Drowning Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:20.084
Drowning. Say it with me. Drowning!

6
00:00:23.561 --> 00:00:27.094
Swim. Say it with me. Swim!

7
00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:34.714
Life jacket. Say it with me. Life jacket!

8
00:00:38.215 --> 00:00:41.732
Reach. Say it with me. Reach!

9
00:00:45.215 --> 00:00:48.499
Throw. Say it with me. Throw!

10
00:00:52.014 --> 00:00:55.831
Supervision. Say it with me. Supervision!

11
00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:03.133
Deep water. Say it with me. Deep water!

12
00:01:06.627 --> 00:01:10.277
Call for help. Say it with me. Call for help!

13
00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:27.267
Drowning can happen fast and silently. Learn to swim, wear a life jacket, and swim only with supervision. To help someone, reach or throw something to them — do not jump into deep water — and call for help.

14
00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:28.681
I can do that too!

15
00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:35.303
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.353 --> 00:01:36.611
Life jacket!

17
00:01:37.739 --> 00:01:43.051
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.101 --> 00:01:44.251
Deep water!

19
00:01:45.261 --> 00:01:52.800
Did you know? Drowning is a leading cause of death for children in many countries, including in Southeast Asia!

20
00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:54.924
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.654 --> 00:02:04.022
Think and answer. Why is it dangerous to jump in to save someone?

22
00:02:04.072 --> 00:02:05.222
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.441 --> 00:02:11.364
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.414 --> 00:02:13.980
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

